Bio: (No one knows who is X. He has appeared somewhere in the corner of the world, where there is no light at all, thirty years ago, starting secretly gathering an army of loyal servants, spies and warriors wanting to conquer the whole world. Despite he has thousands of followers, no one ever seen him before or know where he is. All X's identity is a mystery. Still, he has spies and servants all across the world - even on Olympus);

Secret: (X is in fact Chronos who somehow survived the battle against gods and now secretly gathering new army to defeat them. No one knows about his real identity and he doesn't want to reveal the truth to anyone);
